00:01:28.520 --> 00:01:31.880
"New Tokyo to Greater Osaka (final stop)"

00:01:37.660 --> 00:01:39.820
Well, this is goodbye!

00:01:40.300 --> 00:01:43.600
Yeah. Next time come when
